# The vendored canonical token sheet. AGENTS.md: it is a copy, and a copy can
# drift - when the canonical file in `dileepadev/docs/brand/` changes, re-copy
# it rather than patching it here. Formatting it would rewrite lines the source
# does not have, and every later re-copy would then show a spurious diff.
app/brand-tokens.css

# Generated, not written. `openapi.json` is the API's published spec and
# `lib/api-schema.ts` is produced from it by `npm run api:types`; formatting
# either one means the next regeneration reverts the change.
openapi.json
lib/api-schema.ts

# Build output and dependencies.
.next/
node_modules/

# Prose is hand-wrapped, not machine-wrapped. Every Markdown file here is
# wrapped to a deliberate measure and uses `*emphasis*` and indented fences;
# Prettier rewrites all three. Formatting code is worth a tool, formatting
# sentences is worth an argument with one.
*.md
